  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through MEANINGFUL WORK in Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MEANINGFUL WORK will empower marginalised youth (age 13-30), particularly youth with disabilities, to secure financial stability and to take control of their economic opportunities. This is done mainly through vocational trainings, job placement; as well as saving and investment groups, entrepreneurship trainings &amp; and awareness &amp; advocacy campaigns. Youth with disabilities will also be empowered to stand up for their rights; receive assistive aids; and be supported back to school and work.</narrative>
  </description>
